+## Experimental FoloToy AI Passport
+
+Use the `muse-folotoy-ai-passport` overlay and `tools/muse/board.sh build passport`. This bench profile uses the compact Muse UI, three ADC keys, ES8311 audio and CW2017 battery meter. OK is push-to-talk; UP/DOWN opens the menu, then moves the selection; OK selects; hold DOWN for 0.5 seconds to return. Without PSRAM it uses Link voice upload and text replies, with tunnel, downloaded images and OTA disabled. USB-present/charging detection is not validated: USB is reported present to disable automatic battery sleep; software power-off is unsupported. Use the physical switch. Read the external experiment report for actual test status.
